   "is_new": true,
   "source": {
    "label": "thm:ucb",
    "number": "Theorem 2",
    "quote": "If $\\alpha > 2$ and $\\theta \\in \\Theta$, then the algorithm UCB-S suffers an expected regret of at most \\E R_n \\leq {2\\maxgap K(\\alpha - 1) \\over \\alpha - 2} + \\sum_{i \\in A'} {8\\alpha\\sigma^2 \\log n \\over \\gap{i}} + \\sum_i \\gap{i}"
   },
   "confidence": "high",
   "notes": "Regret defined via gaps, so pseudo-regret. UCB-S does not use n, so anytime. Computation depends on structure."
  },
  {
   "id": "r2",
